  "name": "Apple-Cranberry Crumble",
  "subtitle": "A warmly spiced baked fruit dessert with a crisp buttery topping.",
  "description": "Tart cranberries and tender apples bake beneath a cinnamon-spiced crumble topping for a simple seasonal dessert.",
  "meal_type": "dessert",
